  "worked_solution": "Using the formula for the distance, we have\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\text{d}(c,0) & =\u2016c-0\u2016 \\\\  & =\u2016c\u2016 \\\\  & =\\sqrt{{c}_{1}^{2}+{c}_{2}^{2}+{c}_{3}^{2}+{c}_{4}^{2}+{c}_{5}^{2}} \\\\  & =\\sqrt{(-3)^{2}+{0}^{2}+{2}^{2}+{4}^{2}+(\\sqrt{7})^{2}} \\\\  & =\\sqrt{9+0+4+16+7} \\\\  & =\\sqrt{36} \\\\  & =6.\\end{aligned}\n$$",
